The plate is about 340 px across in the image. If it's a 20-26 cm plate, that is roughly 0.07 cm per px at 26 cm. I'll treat it as a side plate of about 22 cm, so roughly 0.065 cm per px.

The food looks like scrambled eggs. The main clump is about 180 x 100 px, which is roughly 11 x 6.5 cm. Its height is about 2 cm. I assume it fills about 50% of that box, so the volume is about 11 × 6.5 × 2 × 0.5 ≈ 70 cm³. At about 0.8 g/cm³ for fluffy eggs, that comes to roughly 55 g. Adding the small separate piece of about 8 g gives about 65 g in total.

